<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Startup Registration Process in Pune - 6 Steps</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Patron manages the complete founder-to-funded chain - from entity incorporation to DPIIT recognition to tax benefits and ongoing compliance.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Incorporate the Business Entity with RoC Pune</h3><p class="step-description">Pvt Ltd via SPICe+ (RUN name 1-2 days, SPICe+ filing, MOA/AOA, DIN, DSC, COI with PAN/TAN/GST/EPFO/ESIC: 7-12 days) or LLP via FiLLiP (7-10 days). Most Pune VC-backed startups choose Pvt Ltd for shareholder flexibility and ESOP capability. For existing entities < 10 years: skip to Step 2.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Entity Incorporated</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> PAN/TAN Ready</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="65" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="30" y="25" width="55" height="35" rx="4" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1"/><text x="57" y="47" font-size="9" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">SPICe+</text><circle cx="90" cy="18" r="10" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M86 18L89 21L95 15" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Founded</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div>
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Register on Startup India Portal</h3><p class="step-description">Create profile on startupindia.gov.in with founder details, CIN/LLPIN from incorporation, and basic business description. Foundation for DPIIT recognition application.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Profile Created</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Portal Ready</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="15" width="90" height="55" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="25" y="25" width="70" height="35" rx="4" fill="#E8EDF4" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="47" font-size="9" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">startupindia</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Registered</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div>
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">Prepare and File DPIIT Recognition Application</h3><p class="step-description">Most critical step. Patron CA team drafts innovation narrative - technology differentiation, problem-solution fit, scalability, employment/wealth creation potential. Upload incorporation certificate, pitch deck, patent/trademark applications, revenue data. Must clearly differentiate from routine businesses.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Narrative Drafted</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Application Filed</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="65" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><line x1="35" y1="28" x2="85" y2="28" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="35" y1="40" x2="80" y2="40" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.3"/><circle cx="90" cy="68" r="12" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="90" y="72" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">DPIIT</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Under Review</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div>
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">Receive DPIIT Recognition Certificate</h3><p class="step-description">DPIIT issues Certificate of Recognition in 2-7 working days. Downloadable from portal with DPIIT recognition number. Unlocks: GeM procurement, self-certification under 9 laws, IPR concessions, eligibility for Section 80IAC and Section 56.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Certificate Issued</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Benefits Unlocked</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="25" y="10" width="70" height="60" rx="6" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2"/><text x="60" y="35" font-size="10" fill="#14365F" font-weight="800" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">DPIIT</text><text x="60" y="52" font-size="8" fill="#10B981" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Recognised</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">DPIIT Recognised</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div>
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 5</span><h3 class="step-title">Apply for Tax Benefits (80IAC and Section 56)</h3><p class="step-description">Section 80IAC (3-year tax exemption) requires SEPARATE application to DPIIT - goes to IMB for evaluation. Only Pvt Ltd/LLP incorporated after 1 April 2016 eligible. Section 56 angel tax relief: declaration on portal exempting share premium. Patron files both immediately after recognition.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> 80IAC Filed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Sec 56 Done</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="15" width="45" height="55" rx="6" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1"/><text x="37" y="47" font-size="8" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">80IAC</text><rect x="65" y="15" width="40" height="55" rx="6" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1"/><text x="85" y="47" font-size="8" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Sec 56</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Tax Optimised</span><span class="step-number-large">05</span></div></div></div>
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 6</span><h3 class="step-title">Register MSInS and Set Up Compliance</h3><p class="step-description">MSInS on Maharashtra Startup Portal for state Unique ID, seed funding (Rs 15-50 lakh), incubation. Simultaneously: GST returns calendar, PTRC/PTEC on mahagst.gov.in, Tally/Zoho Books with startup chart of accounts, ROC calendar (INC-20A within 180 days, annual filings), statutory registers.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> MSInS Done</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Compliance Active</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="15" width="45" height="55" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="22" y="25" width="31" height="6" rx="2" fill="#10B981" opacity="0.4"/><rect x="22" y="36" width="31" height="6" rx="2" fill="#F5A623" opacity="0.4"/><rect x="68" y="15" width="40" height="55" rx="6" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="88" cy="42" r="12" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M83 42L86 45L93 38" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Fully Operational</span><span class="step-number-large">06</span></div></div></div>
            

